  "equipmentJudgmentImplications": [
    "Use profession primary attribute and actual damage-source components; one skill may have multiple elements.",
    "Represent captured minion, summon, proc, direct hit and DoT ownership separately.",
    "Conditional enemy bonuses require target HP, range, elite flag and status availability; status access is not permanent uptime.",
    "Track effect provenance so panel totals, talents, consumables and temporary buffs are not added twice.",
    "Attack-speed, mana and cooldown improvements address different bottlenecks; keep contextual explanations instead of asking user for weights.",
    "Thorns, max-health scaling, mana-to-intelligence conversion and talent changes can make apparently secondary affixes useful.",
    "Separate item retention, current build relevance and immediate replacement; later unlocks can justify retaining future candidates.",
    "Unverified formulas, effects or OCR facts prevent definitive discard or real-DPS improvement claims."
  ],
